/*
 * Memory spaces:
 * Hose numbers are assigned as follows:
 *		0 - pachip 0 / G Port
 *		1 - pachip 1 / G Port
 * 		2 - pachip 0 / A Port
 *      	3 - pachip 1 / A Port
